{"seq":1,"slug":"lsm-tree-structure-write-path","title":"LSM-tree 分层结构、memtable/WAL 与写路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/lsm-architecture-write-read/lsm-tree-structure-write-path","wordCount":2158,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"lsm-tree-分层结构-memtable-wal-与写路径\">LSM-tree 分层结构、memtable/WAL 与写路径</h1><p>RocksDB 把一次 <code>Put</code> 变成三件事同时发生：写入内存中的 memtable、追加到磁盘上的 WAL、并在 memtable 写满后被后台线程排空成一个不可变的 SST 文件。这个「先内存、后落盘、再归并」的序列就是 Log-Structured Merge-tree 的全部承诺——把随机写改造成顺序写。代价是读路径要跨越更多层、写放大随层数累积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个组件与一条写路径\">核心概念：三个组件与一条写路径</h2><p>RocksDB 的存储引擎由三个构件组成（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/RocksDB-Overview\">RocksDB Overview</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>memtable</strong> —— 内存中的有序结构，默认是跳表（skiplist）。所有写入先落在这里。</li>\n<li><strong>WAL（write-ahead log）</strong> —— 顺序追加的磁盘日志，用于进程崩溃后的恢复。</li>\n<li><strong>SST 文件</strong> —— memtable 写满后刷成的有序只读文件，落在 L0 层。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一次写请求的路径是确定的：先写 WAL，再写 memtable，memtable 超出 <code>write_buffer_size</code> 后转为 immutable memtable，后台线程把它刷成 L0 的一个 SST，同时对应的 WAL 段变为可删除。SST 再经 compaction 逐层下沉到 L1、L2……直到 Lmax。整条链路上只有 WAL 追加和 SST 顺序写是磁盘操作，随机写被彻底消灭。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Put / Delete / Merge] --&gt; B[WriteBatch 组装]&#10;    B --&gt; C[WAL 顺序追加]&#10;    C --&gt; D[memtable 跳表写入]&#10;    D --&gt; E{超过 write_buffer_size?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[继续接收写]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[转为 immutable memtable]&#10;    G --&gt; H[后台 flush 线程]&#10;    H --&gt; I[L0 SST 文件]&#10;    I --&gt; J[compaction 归并下沉]&#10;    J --&gt; K[L1 ... Lmax]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|崩溃恢复重放| D\">graph TD\n    A[Put / Delete / Merge] --&gt; B[WriteBatch 组装]\n    B --&gt; C[WAL 顺序追加]\n    C --&gt; D[memtable 跳表写入]\n    D --&gt; E{超过 write_buffer_size?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[继续接收写]\n    E --&gt;|是| G[转为 immutable memtable]\n    G --&gt; H[后台 flush 线程]\n    H --&gt; I[L0 SST 文件]\n    I --&gt; J[compaction 归并下沉]\n    J --&gt; K[L1 ... Lmax]\n    C -.-&gt;|崩溃恢复重放| D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>数据结构</th>\n<th>持久性角色</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>memtable</td>\n<td>跳表（默认）/ vector / prefix-hash</td>\n<td>无（进程崩溃即失）</td>\n<td><code>write_buffer_size</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WAL</td>\n<td>顺序追加日志</td>\n<td>崩溃一致性</td>\n<td><code>WriteOptions::sync</code>、<code>max_total_wal_size</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SST (L0)</td>\n<td>有序块表，键区间可重叠</td>\n<td>持久</td>\n<td><code>level0_file_num_compaction_trigger</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SST (L1+)</td>\n<td>有序块表，层内不重叠</td>\n<td>持久</td>\n<td><code>max_bytes_for_level_base</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区别在 L0 与 L1+ 之间：L0 文件来自独立的 memtable flush，彼此的键区间<strong>允许重叠</strong>；L1 及以下每层是一个有序 run，层内文件不重叠（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/RocksDB-Overview\">RocksDB Overview</a>）。读一个键在 L0 可能要探测多个文件，在 L1+ 每层最多命中一个——这条不对称是读放大的主要来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"memtable-写缓冲的结构选型与内存账\">Memtable：写缓冲的结构选型与内存账</h2><p>memtable 默认用跳表，原因不是它最快，而是它对「写与范围扫描交错发生」最稳：插入、查找、按序迭代都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，且无需全局锁即可支持并发插入。RocksDB 另有两种特化实现（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/RocksDB-Overview\">RocksDB Overview</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>vector memtable</strong>：把每次写追加进无序列，flush 时整体排序再写 L0，把排序成本推迟到 flush，适合批量导入。</li>\n<li><strong>prefix-hash memtable</strong>：按 key 前缀哈希分桶，让同前缀的 get/put/scan 更局部。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>内存账由三个参数决定，默认值直接决定一次 flush 的粒度和缓冲深度（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/MemTable\">RocksDB MemTable wiki</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>write_buffer_size</code></td>\n<td>64 MB</td>\n<td>单个 memtable 的字节上限，触达即转 immutable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_write_buffer_number</code></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>内存中允许存在的 memtable 数上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min_write_buffer_number_to_merge</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>flush 前至少要合并的 immutable memtable 数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>db_write_buffer_size</code></td>\n<td>0（禁用）</td>\n<td>跨列族的 memtable 总内存上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>write_buffer_manager</code></td>\n<td>nullptr</td>\n<td>自定义全局内存管理器，覆盖 <code>db_write_buffer_size</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>max_write_buffer_number = 2</code> 的含义是：一个 memtable 写满转入后台 flush 时，前台仍能用另一个活动 memtable 接收写——这是「写停顿」缓冲的全部余量。把 <code>min_write_buffer_number_to_merge</code> 提到 2 或更高，会让 flush 前先合并多个 immutable memtable，减少 L0 中重复键、降低 L0 文件数，代价是这些 memtable 在内存里停留更久。<code>write_buffer_manager</code> 是跨列族做全局内存预算的正确工具：没有它时 <code>db_write_buffer_size</code> 按「谁最大先刷谁」驱逐，粒度粗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wal-持久化的开关-生命周期与回收\">WAL：持久化的开关、生命周期与回收</h2><p>WAL 决定了「写成功」这个返回值的真实含义。<code>WriteOptions</code> 提供三个正交的持久化旋钮（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Basic-Operations\">RocksDB Basic Operations</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>WriteOptions::sync = true</code>：等待数据真正到达持久存储才返回。POSIX 下走 <code>fsync</code>、<code>fdatasync</code> 或 <code>msync(..., MS_SYNC)</code>。</li>\n<li><code>sync = false</code>（默认）：只有进程崩溃不丢已确认的写；机器掉电可能丢最近的更新。</li>\n<li><code>write_options.disableWAL = true</code>：该次写不进 WAL，进程崩溃即丢——仅在外部已有日志或接受丢数据时使用。</li>\n<li><code>options.manual_wal_flush = true</code>：WAL 先驻留内部缓冲，由应用显式 <code>FlushWAL</code> 排放，用于把多次写批量落盘。</li>\n<li><code>Options::use_fsync = true</code>：把默认的 <code>fdatasync()</code> 换成 <code>fsync()</code>，在 ext3 一类文件系统上更安全。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常被误读的边界：<code>sync = false</code> 下进程被 kill 不会丢失已确认的写（数据已在 OS 缓冲区），丢失场景严格限定为<strong>整机断电</strong>。要覆盖整机断电，必须 <code>sync = true</code> 或周期性 <code>DB::SyncWAL()</code>。</p>\n<p>WAL 不是按列族划分的——<strong>单个 WAL 记录所有列族的写日志</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Write-Ahead-Log-%28WAL%29\">RocksDB WAL wiki</a>）。推论有两条：任何一个列族还没刷过某序列号，共享的那段 WAL 就不能删除；旧 WAL 只有在<strong>所有列族</strong>都刷过它最大的序列号之后才可删除或归档。</p>\n<p>WAL 的回收由大小与时间两个维度驱动：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>DBOptions::max_total_wal_size</code>：WAL 总大小超过它时，RocksDB 强制刷掉持最旧数据的列族，让旧 WAL 变为可回收，同时也是 WAL 段轮转的触发条件（OVERVIEW 与 WAL wiki 均描述为「WAL 尺寸触达该值即新建」）。</li>\n<li><code>wal_dir</code>：把 WAL 与数据文件分目录存放，可让日志落在持久介质、数据落在快速介质上。</li>\n<li><code>WAL_ttl_seconds</code> 与 <code>WAL_size_limit_MB</code>：控制<strong>已归档</strong> WAL 的保留策略（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Basic-Operations\">RocksDB Basic Operations</a>）。两者都为 0 时 WAL 一可删就删、不归档；TTL 为 0 而 size limit 非 0 时每 10 分钟检查，从最旧开始删到总量低于限制；TTL 非 0 而 size limit 为 0 时按 <code>WAL_ttl_seconds / 2</code> 周期删除超 TTL 文件；两者都非 0 时每 10 分钟检查、先判 TTL。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一条隐蔽的运维约束：事务日志迭代器可从归档 WAL 读出并发送给从库重放，因此一旦启用基于 WAL 的复制，归档 WAL 的删除会被延后（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Write-Ahead-Log-%28WAL%29\">RocksDB WAL wiki</a>）。这会让 <code>WAL_ttl_seconds</code> 的实际生效晚于预期，磁盘占用随之上涨。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写路径上的放大与分层形状\">写路径上的放大与分层形状</h2><p>写放大的来源可以精确拆成三部分。设一次用户写在被 compaction 彻底收纳前平均被重写 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 次，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{amp} = W_{wal} + W_{flush} + \\sum_{i=0}^{L-1} W_{compaction,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{wal}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是日志追加（约 1 次写），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{flush}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是刷 L0（1 次），compaction 项是每次归并重写数据的成本。层式 compaction 下每层数据稳定态约为上一层的 <code>max_bytes_for_level_multiplier</code> 倍，默认 10，<code>num_levels</code> 默认 7（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/RocksDB-Tuning-Guide\">RocksDB Tuning Guide</a>）。即第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层容量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0 \\cdot 10^{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一条数据从 L0 沉到 L3 至少要 3 次归并重写。这就是「层越多、空间利用率越高、写放大越大」的结构性权衡。</p>\n<p>L0 的堆积是写停顿的前置信号，三个触发阈值构成一条升级链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[L0 文件数] --&gt; B{达到 level0_file_num_compaction_trigger}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[调度 L0 compaction]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[正常运行]&#10;    C --&gt; E{达到 level0_slowdown_writes_trigger}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[放慢前台写速率]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[继续]&#10;    F --&gt; H{达到 level0_stop_writes_trigger}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[完全停止前台写]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[继续放慢]\">flowchart TD\n    A[L0 文件数] --&gt; B{达到 level0_file_num_compaction_trigger}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[调度 L0 compaction]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[正常运行]\n    C --&gt; E{达到 level0_slowdown_writes_trigger}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[放慢前台写速率]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[继续]\n    F --&gt; H{达到 level0_stop_writes_trigger}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[完全停止前台写]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[继续放慢]</pre><p>Tuning Guide 给出的层式示例配置里，前缀数据库在闪存上的取值为：<code>write_buffer_size</code> 64 MB、L0 compaction 触发 10、slowdown 触发 20、stop 触发 40，<code>target_file_size_base</code> 64 MB，<code>max_bytes_for_level_base</code> 512 MB（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/RocksDB-Tuning-Guide\">RocksDB Tuning Guide</a>）。该文档的经验公式是让 L1 与 L0 规模相近，稳定态 L0 大小约等于：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">write_buffer_size</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">min_write_buffer_number_to_merge</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">level0_file_num_compaction_trigger</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{L0} \\approx \\texttt{write\\_buffer\\_size} \\times \\texttt{min\\_write\\_buffer\\_number\\_to\\_merge} \\times \\texttt{level0\\_file\\_num\\_compaction\\_trigger}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7063em;vertical-align:-0.0951em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">write_buffer_size</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">min_write_buffer_number_to_merge</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">level0_file_num_compaction_trigger</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入 64 MB × 1 × 10 得 640 MB 左右——若 <code>max_bytes_for_level_base</code> 远小于此，compaction 来不及消化 L0；远大于此，L1 长期空转。<code>target_file_size_base</code> 建议取 <code>max_bytes_for_level_base / 10</code>，即 L1 里约 10 个文件。</p>\n<p>compaction 风格决定放大的分布：<strong>leveled</strong>（默认 <code>kCompactionStyleLevel</code>）空间放大最低，但 L0→L1 默认单线程且阻塞 L1→L2；<strong>universal</strong> 写放大更低，但读放大与空间放大更高，compaction 期间临时空间可能翻倍，Tuning Guide 建议超过 100 GB 就谨慎并考虑分片；<strong>FIFO</strong> 让文件停留在 L0，总量超过 <code>CompactionOptionsFIFO::max_table_files_size</code> 时删除最旧文件，只适合缓存型数据（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/RocksDB-Overview\">RocksDB Overview</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/RocksDB-Tuning-Guide\">Tuning Guide</a>）。compaction 优先级默认是 <code>kMinOverlappingRatio</code>；SSD 上开多线程 compaction 相对单线程可把持续写吞吐提升到约 10 倍（同上 Overview）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本锚点与工程含义\">版本锚点与工程含义</h2><p>RocksDB 的发布节奏可供对齐：11.x 系列 11.0.0 发布于 2026-02-23，11.8.1 是最新补丁（2026-07-28）；10.x 覆盖 2025-08 至 2026-02（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/releases\">RocksDB Releases</a>）。参数语义在 10.x→11.x 间保持稳定，上文默认值与 wiki 一致。</p>\n<p>把写路径三段拼起来，工程决策收敛为四个可验证的问题——持久性用 <code>sync</code>/<code>SyncWAL()</code> 定档，内存用 <code>write_buffer_size × max_write_buffer_number</code> 加上跨列族的 <code>write_buffer_manager</code> 封顶，WAL 占用看是否有列族 flush 落后以及是否启用了复制，L0 是否堵塞看三层阈值间距。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RocksDB 用 memtable（跳表）+ WAL + SST 把随机写改造成顺序写；写路径永远是「先 WAL、后 memtable、再后台 flush」。</li>\n<li>memtable 默认 64 MB（<code>write_buffer_size</code>），内存中最多 2 个（<code>max_write_buffer_number</code>）；<code>min_write_buffer_number_to_merge</code> 控制 flush 前合并粒度。</li>\n<li>WAL 是崩溃一致性的唯一来源，且<strong>跨列族共享</strong>；<code>sync</code> / <code>disableWAL</code> / <code>manual_wal_flush</code> 是三个正交旋钮。</li>\n<li>WAL 回收受「所有列族是否已刷过」及 <code>max_total_wal_size</code>、<code>WAL_ttl_seconds</code>、<code>WAL_size_limit_MB</code> 约束。</li>\n<li>写放大 = WAL × 1 + flush × 1 + 各层 compaction 重写；层式默认每层 10 倍（<code>max_bytes_for_level_multiplier</code>），<code>num_levels</code> 默认 7。</li>\n<li>L0 的 compaction / slowdown / stop 三层阈值是写停顿的预警阶梯，应与 <code>write_buffer_size</code> 和 <code>max_bytes_for_level_base</code> 一起调优。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LSM-tree 分层结构、memtable/WAL 与写路径","id":"lsm-tree-分层结构-memtable-wal-与写路径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个组件与一条写路径","id":"核心概念-三个组件与一条写路径"},{"level":2,"text":"Memtable：写缓冲的结构选型与内存账","id":"memtable-写缓冲的结构选型与内存账"},{"level":2,"text":"WAL：持久化的开关、生命周期与回收","id":"wal-持久化的开关-生命周期与回收"},{"level":2,"text":"写路径上的放大与分层形状","id":"写路径上的放大与分层形状"},{"level":2,"text":"版本锚点与工程含义","id":"版本锚点与工程含义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"读路径、查找放大与 Bloom filter/block cache 协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/lsm-architecture-write-read/read-path-lookup-amplification"}}